  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now we know that,</p><p>Shortest distance between two skew lines is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Now finding,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now putting the value in formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>54</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
